      "               MAE_mean     MAE_sd   RMSE_mean    RMSE_sd   R2_mean     R2_sd\n",
      "model                                                                        \n",
      "quadratic    137.483383  34.150028  196.821412  33.800045  0.980994  0.004342\n",
